     76  f008							; spent (b7) latch filtered; this body re-checks the phase (s4-12).
     77  f008							; In:	CollisionX = 8n (prefix width px), CollisionCellX = band (0-2),
     78  f008							;	Y = hot (full MetaB byte, bank2-staged; masked here). Out: RoomX
     79  f008							;	clamped out of the left prefix [0,8n) / the TIA mirror [160-8n,160);
     80  f008							;	A/X/Y + CollisionX clobbered.
